 costs more money  even though it doesn't come with that  power adapter it is 60 dollars compared  to 40. we thought apples was already  pricey and it is  but they're charging even more than  apple does now i kind of understand it  because one you get a much larger cable  that is braided two it also has the  built-in kickstand and in general the  quality of this thing is awesome i have  to say the kickstand has no play  whatsoever a lot of the third-party  options kind of suck they're flimsy they  could easily break so you are getting a  quality product with extra features for  that price now the third downside is if  you buy belkin's option you have to be  aware of this you will not be able to  use one of the many third-party  accessories that have been created for  apple's puck so for example we have this  adjustable stand that is very  inexpensive kind of lifts up your phone  off of the table and you can kind of  adjust it whichever way you would like  of course there's many car mounting  options there's so many different  accessories for these pucks that you can  buy now that won't matter if you're just  planning to use it at your desk but if  you want to have the ability to change  up what you do with it in the future you  are not going to have that with belkin's  charger and now with all of that out of  the way let me go ahead and go and do  some testing and we'll see just how fast  belkin's option is alright guys we are  done and as you know these charging  tests take forever so hit that thumbs up  button if you guys appreciate it i use  the same phone as before same power  adapter 20 watt from apple and we have  some interesting results so after the  first 10 minutes the belkan is actually  slightly slower at 9  compared to 10 but jumping another 10  minutes to 20 it is actually beating it  out now at 22  and then the trend kind of goes on after  a half hour the bell can reach 33 charge  compared to 30 now of course it's not a  huge difference  but it is charging the phone faster  which is interesting and then let's jump  all the way up to 50 minutes and here  the lead gets even bigger we have 51  compared to 46 so that is 5  higher charge than apple's puck now i'm  guessing that's just because of the  larger size and less heat because the  iphone does limit the charging speed  based on thermals  now going up longer let's say let's go  to an hour and 15  here we actually have an even bigger  difference now six percent so as you can  see it kind of fluctuates a little bit  there and then jumping to an hour and 45  minutes we have 91 charge compared to  84. now if you guys don't know when  you're wirelessly charging once you hit  90 percent the charging slows down  dramatically so here after 91 percent  the belkan slows down apple starts to  catch up so at the two hour mark we have  a difference of six percent here 90 with  apples 96 with the belkins and at 2  hours and 15 minutes the belkin actually  finishes up it finishes that last amount  fairly quickly so it takes 2 hours and  15 minutes for the belkin magsay 15 watt  charger to fully charge this iphone  whereas the iphone with the apple  charger it actually takes two hours and  45 minutes to fully charge so yes the  belkin charger is faster as well likely  just due to thermals and not heating up  your phone as much being able to suck  some of that  heat out of your phone and it charges 30  minutes faster than apple's puck that  apple makes themselves so if you're  somebody that wants to use wireless  charging but you also want to charge  faster then the belkin is better at that  compared to apples and then of course it  has the extra features with the longer  cable and that kickstand as well so  there you guys go let me know down below  where any of you guys expecting a  third-party option to actually charge  faster than apples using the same exact  20 watt puck or 20 watt adapter with  this puck i want to hear your guys's  opinions and which one would you buy  would you just stick with apple's one  for 40 bucks or would you be willing to  spend the extra 20  for belkin's option to have those extra  features overall i have to say that i'm  fairly impressed i did not think it's  going to be this high quality um this is  even better quality at least the field  than apples even though it doesn't have  aluminum the plastic is excellent the  pad here is nice and soft the kickstand  is great having this long cable is nice  and with that cable tie so if you don't  need the extra length you don't have to  use it and then of course for traveling  it's nice to be able to pack it up nice  and small  overall i'm very impressed and i would  highly recommend this option now if  you're somebody wants to save some money  there are still third party options that  look very similar into apple's you'll  get the fastest charging speed so if you  don't care about that we'll go ahead and  link all of this stuff down below in the  description of this video go ahead and  click that circle above to subscribe to  help us reach our goal of 1 million  subscribers check out one of those great  videos right over there that's been max  and i will see you in the next video  [Music]

